	(text_box "NOTES:\n- Every button should have an debouncing circuit, because there is no software debouncing (exept the Encoder Button).\n- The button mappings can be changed in the code. These button mapping show my implementation for my wheel.\n- Don´t connect the pi to USB, while it is connected to the wheelbase, because the ~5v on Vsys will destroy the Wheelbase\n- The not connected pin in the wheelbase connector is the PA14 pin, which is probably only used during firmware upate of the original wheel.\n- The pullup resistors for the encoder are already on most encoder breakout boards. "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 137.16 19.05 0)
		(size 147.32 39.37)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a547520-c591-4a0b-9a4d-ee3349c7f31f")
	)
